  {
   "id": 3627,
   "hub_id": 10648,
   "version": "1.1.1",
   "description": "<ul>\n<li>Updated for SPT 3.9.0</li>\n<li>This release will not work on previous versions of SPT</li>\n<li>Changed custom magazines to use mongoID’s</li>\n<li>Added possible SLAAP armor to MODXII helmets</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you want Painter services tab (buying clothing from Tactical Gear Component) then you have to install <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2098-trader-service-fix/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">this mod</a> and add the json file in the Trader folder that you find in the zip of Painter. Now you can buy clothing and use them. BSG changed so you now need a client plugin for trader services. It sucks I know but there is no way around it. Make sure to install TraderServicesFix into BepInEx/plugins. NOT user/mods.</p>\n",
   "link": "https://sp-mod.com/mod/download/1125/tactical-gear-component/1.1.1",
   "content_length": null,
   "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.0",
   "downloads": 6060,
